(=== 5. Incident report, 2 May ===) '
() '
(At 03:12 the monitoring system flagged repeated failed logins against the HR portal from a) '
(single address. Tomasz traced them to a laptop belonging to Bob Tanaka, the contractor whose) '
(real name is Robert Tanaka. Bob had reused his old portal login, bob.tanaka@northwind-) '
(logistics.com, and the password he used was tanaka_2019_summer. His account was locked.) '
() '
(Elena Vasquez interviewed Robert the next morning. He confirmed he had not shared his login.) '
(Marcus Thompson reviewed the logs and found nothing else. Priya's team was told that no payroll) '
(data was accessed.) '
() '
(=== 6. Performance review, Mei-Ling Chen ===) '
() '
(Mei-Ling has been outstanding this year. She rebuilt the routing optimiser, cut delivery delays) '
(by a fifth and mentored Aisha through her first quarter. Marcus Thompson recommends promotion.) '
(Her current salary of $98,000 is below the market rate, which is why the offer above was) '
(raised.) '
() '
(Reviewer's note: Mei-Ling asked that her review is not shared with Daniel O'Connor.) '
ET
